<title>FRANCE: France sells 435 mln Ecu OATs at auction.</title>
<headline>France sells 435 mln Ecu OATs at auction.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury sold the following government bonds (OATs) at auction on Thursday.</p>
<p> MATURITY	COUPON	SALE AMOUNT     AVERAGE YIELD</p>
<p> 25.APR.07	5.50	   230 MLN	   6.12</p>
<p> BID AMT/COVER    NON-COMPETITIVE BIDS   LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE</p>
<p> 1.075 BLN/4.7		     NIL	     95.42</p>
<p> PCT ALLOTED AT LOWEST PRICE*		  PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p> 50.0						    26.JUN</p>
<p> * PRICES ABOVE GOT ALLOTMENTS IN FULL     NEXT AUCTION</p>
<p>							    N/A</p>
<p> MATURITY	COUPON	SALE AMOUNT     AVERAGE YIELD</p>
<p> 25.APR.02	6.75	   205 MLN	   5.11</p>
<p> BID AMT/COVER    NON-COMPETITIVE BIDS   LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE</p>
<p> 770 MLN/3.8		     NIL		 106.84</p>
<p> PCT ALLOTED AT LOWEST PRICE*		  PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p> 100.0						   26.JUN</p>
<p> * PRICES ABOVE GOT ALLOTMENTS IN FULL     NEXT OFFER</p>
<p>							    N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - The Treasury originally announced it would sell 300 to 500 Million Ecu of OATs in total today. The total bid cover ratio of the auction was 4.2.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
